    {
      "id": "planner-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 372.5,
      "width": 1848,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g-planner"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1562038364,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 259241515,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Writes four searches from the claims and names. Instructed not to say whether the story is true.\n\u2022 quoted headline \u2014 look for the same article\n\u2022 event boolean (names AND event) \u2014 look for the same kind of event\n\u2022 fact-check paraphrase \u2014 look for a prior ClaimReview\n\u2022 entity names \u2014 look up people / organisations / places on Wikipedia",
      "originalText": "Writes four searches from the claims and names. Instructed not to say whether the story is true.\n\u2022 quoted headline \u2014 look for the same article\n\u2022 event boolean (names AND event) \u2014 look for the same kind of event\n\u2022 fact-check paraphrase \u2014 look for a prior ClaimReview\n\u2022 entity names \u2014 look up people / organisations / places on Wikipedia",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q1",
