      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Drop duplicate URLs. Rank remaining articles by similarity to the claims; prefer different publisher families.\nThen classify existence: exact URL match \u00b7 title match \u00b7 near-duplicate \u00b7 syndicate / reprint \u00b7 not found.\n\u201cNot found\u201d, empty results, or a skipped API are missing coverage \u2014 not evidence the story is fake.",
      "originalText": "Drop duplicate URLs. Rank remaining articles by similarity to the claims; prefer different publisher families.\nThen classify existence: exact URL match \u00b7 title match \u00b7 near-duplicate \u00b7 syndicate / reprint \u00b7 not found.\n\u201cNot found\u201d, empty results, or a skipped API are missing coverage \u2014 not evidence the story is fake.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
